No video is generally an indication of memory problems.  On an SX, you
need to have one (or both) banks occupied, not just one slot;  do you have
just one RAM chip, or two 64s?

The SX is also rather fussy about its RAM, and it's best to use the brands
and models recommended by DEC.  Others may work, but then again, they may
not.  Annoying, but true.
