Your ram, 1 128meg dimm or 2 64 meg dimms? The SX has
(I think) a 128 bit wide path to memory, so you'll
need to add ram in pairs. The SX is picky about ram.

The next thing I'd check is to make sure the cpu fan
is plugged in, I think the SX has a failsafe that shuts
the system down if the fan dies.

I hope this helps...

