Why send it to runlevel 5? An easier way to do it (not to mention more
secure), is to export your display like this....
[maxx@sonja maxx] export DISPLAY='ip_address_of_client:0.0'
where 'ip_address_of_client' is the ip number of the machine you want X to
run on. This can be the same as the host (but why?!!) or another machine
on your network (like your personal workstation).
then type
wmaker &
to run windowmaker, or similar commands for fvwm, or enlightenment or
whatever WM you use. Also chews up less proc resources on your server.

